  <div class="titleLinkContainer">
    <a href="#7681963"
       class="titleLink"
    >
    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 161-4
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7681963"
    >
Local Zone Coordinator.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7681963" data-guid="7681963"></div>
        <div id="questions-7681963" data-guid="7681963" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7681963_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Upon the designation of such zone, the City Department of Economic Development is hereby designated and shall act as Local Zone Coordinator which shall be responsible for coordinating the tasks necessary for developing, promoting and achieving the economic development and human resource potential of the zone.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
                <article>
                <header>
  <div data-component="h2"
       class="contentTitle barTitle sectionTitle 7681964"
      id="7681964"
