    <span class="titleNumber">
      § 161-5
    </span>
    <span class="titleTitle"
          data-guid="7681964"
    >
When effective.    </span>
    </a>
  </div>
      </label>
  </div>
                </header>
        <div class="notes" id="notes-7681964" data-guid="7681964"></div>
        <div id="questions-7681964" data-guid="7681964" class="questions"></div>


<div class="section_content content" id="7681964_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">This chapter shall take effect immediately upon final passage, approval by the Mayor after public hearing and filing with the office of the Secretary of State.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
      </div>
  </div>

